---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Final-year computer science student in Bangalore, building AI systems that run in production."
>
  <section class="about container grid-12">
    <div class="about__body">
      <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>

      <p class="about__lead">
        I am a final-year computer science student at Atria Institute of
        Technology in Bangalore, graduating in June 2027.
      </p>

      <p>
        I started building things properly in my second year, when a friend and I
        set up a company and I ended up owning the backend by default. That turned
        out to be the fastest way I have found to learn: there is nobody to escalate
        to, so you read the documentation and then you read the source.
      </p>

      <p>
        Since then I have worked on a regulated clinical-trial platform where every
        document needed a tamper-evident history, a WhatsApp agent that handled
        machinery enquiries for buyers across India, and a teaching platform whose
        hardest requirement was knowing when to stay quiet. Alongside those I built
        a brain-computer interface on my desk, which has taught me more about the
        gap between a design document and a working system than anything else.
      </p>

      <h2>How I work</h2>

      <p>
        I measure things. Most of the numbers on this site came out of a log file
        or a database rather than an estimate, and where I have not measured
        something I say so. The brain-computer interface has a real 12.9 dB
        response and no accuracy figure, because I have run one subject and that
        is not enough to claim one.
      </p>

      <p>
        I also try to put safety rules in code rather than in prompts. A prompt
        that says "never do X" is a suggestion; a function that refuses is a rule.
        That belief has shaped nearly every AI system on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Outside the code</h2>

      <p>
        I run the Google Developer Groups chapter on campus, and was its AI/ML lead
        before that. We ran Cepheus 2025, a hackathon with over four hundred
        participants, and I have taken more than a hundred and twenty students
        through Google Cloud Study Jams. Most of what I know about explaining
        technical work to people who do not share my context, I learned standing in
        front of a room.
      </p>

      <h2>Right now</h2>

      <p>
        I am looking for software engineering internships and graduate roles, and I
        take freelance work. If something here is close to a problem you have,
        <a class="wipe" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>email me</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about__side">
      <div class="about__portrait" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="note">Photo to come</span>
      </div>
      <dl class="about__facts">
        <div>
          <dt class="note">Based in</dt>
          <dd>{site.location}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="note">Graduating</dt>
          <dd>June 2027</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="note">Elsewhere</dt>
          <dd class="about__links">
            <a class="wipe" href={site.socials.github}>GitHub</a>
            <a class="wipe" href={site.socials.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 5rem) 0;
    row-gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__body {
    grid-column: 1 / span 12;
  }

  .about__side {
    grid-column: 1 / span 12;
  }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .about__body {
      grid-column: 1 / span 7;
    }
    .about__side {
      grid-column: 9 / span 4;
      position: sticky;
      top: 5.5rem;
    }
  }

  .about__title {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
  }

  .about__lead {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .about__body p {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-top: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .about__body h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
  }

  .about__body a {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  .about__portrait {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .about__facts {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .about__facts dt {
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .about__facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .about__links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
</style>
